"P3560688010" "I remember little about my life before the Lost, but I remember one person: my sister. We were twins, and although I am now so altered she would scarcely recognize me, I still feel a connection to her. Last night, I felt a sharp pang of panic. I believe Tina is in danger from Longbow. Please, help my sister!"
